{
  "schema": "nw.behaviour/1",
  "note": "Open Air's idle behaviour (contract 9.1): the shared defaults with the four hunters of this mode. Tasks only happen where the nav file has a task spot for them, and those spots are always as far from the player as the hunter's own stand spot, never nearer.",
